<section class="bg-white">
  <div class="container-site grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12 items-center">
    <div class="lg:col-span-2">
      <div class="aspect-square rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--color-bg-light)] to-[var(--color-bg-cream)] relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-navy)] text-white text-3xl font-light flex items-center justify-center mx-auto">AB</div>
            <p class="mt-6 font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]">Anna Biram</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-slate)]">Founder & Managing Director</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-3">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[var(--color-navy)] font-light leading-tight">
        Built by a nurse. Run with care.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-[var(--color-slate)] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Naturo Group is led by Anna Biram, a registered nurse who saw firsthand how cleaning impacts dignity, health and recovery for the people she cared for.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, that same compassionate, detail-driven mindset shapes every clean we do — whether it's a regular family home in Bondi or supporting an NDIS participant in Ipswich.
        </p>
        <p>
          We hire carefully, train deeply, and treat every home like it matters. Because it does.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
